 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Every laugh out there feels wrong today. Then I feel wrong for thinking it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "You walk to the trap line with Ruby. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Most days I don't think about it. Today I am. Appreciate you noticing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Have you heard what they're calling The Anaconda Empress? Courtney is pushing 'The Big Beast'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"I'm staying out of the naming fight. For now. Someone always gets precious about their pick.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "You show them Hickory Nuts — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"I'm sorry — I can't shake it. I'm achy and wrung out, barely keeping food down. Will you help me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"The fever's not breaking and I'm barely keeping food down. I need help — real help, not just water.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"The whole fire was arguing about The Anaconda Empress last night — what to even CALL it. 'Big Big' got shouted down. What's your vote?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"I have opinions about the name. I am saving them for when they count.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"I've got things to see to. Don't be a stranger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Never mind the sickness I'm fighting — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"Ivan is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "They pull back half a step — not leaving, just... further."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I sleep in short shifts for Ivan, now. Feels right. Feels like the least I can do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "You show them Lamb's Quarters — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Ivan owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "You don't answer. The quiet turns pointed."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "The air goes tight. Their eyes narrow, just slightly."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I count portions out loud before eating. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"We bury, we grieve, we keep going. There's no step four.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "You show them Hickory Nuts — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? At night I talk to someone who isn't there anymore. You'd know about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Still on their secret. I mean it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Don't tell anyone I told you. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Ivan is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"I wish there was more to tell. That's it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "Someone has to believe people get better. Might as well be the person with the bandages."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Every person I help is a vote for the world making sense again.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "Something crosses their face — quick, then gone. The practiced expression clicks back into place."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"I wasn't a Baker. I was a mason. The truth felt small. The lie felt like someone worth keeping around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"You're really going to make me say it again?\" Victor rubs their face. \"Fine — but it's the same truth as last time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Healing's slow. People want it fast. I'm learning to be patient with both.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Still on what they want.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. They're really talking to you now."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Right. Sorry, I go on about it. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"I dreamed Ivan was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Alright, duty calls. This was a good pause.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Ligaya sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"I'm sorry — whatever this is, it's getting worse — I'm achy and wrung out, barely keeping food down. Will you help me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"I'm burning up and there's nothing left in me. Someone who knows sickness — please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "You spend time tending them. This was care, not a promise of a cure."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Still on that favor.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Sweet Tooth. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Never mind the pantry run — we got it handled. Thanks anyway. I hate to ask this, but I'm achy and wrung out, barely keeping food down. I need help. Please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"The fever's not breaking and I'm barely keeping food down. I need help — real help, not just water.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"They took you — Sweet Tooth, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"...Actually, forget it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"...Where was I? Gone. Ask me something else.\""
  }
 ],
