  "deathBeat": [
   "d12: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Robin Whelan is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d12: 🕯️ Robin Whelan is dead — the arena. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
   "d13: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Wanda Epstein is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d13: 🕯️ Word comes back with a torn pack and no Wanda. Hummice, out past the ridge. The fire is quieter tonight.",
   "d13: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Nightlight is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
  ],
  "recoverHome": [
   "d13: That night, they bring Robin home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."
  ],
  "vouch": [],
  "systemVoice": [
   "d12: SYSTEM: \"Perimeter violated! This is unprecedented! ...Is this unprecedented? Checking. Yes. Unprecedented.\"",
   "d12: ◈ ARC III — ENGINES. SYSTEM: \"VIEWERSHIP MILESTONE. Organic unit demonstrates compounding capability. Resonance protocols unlocked.\" — Your gifts deepen. Used in sequence, they resonate. The village is no longer just surviving. It is becoming something.",
   "d13: SYSTEM: \"INTRUDER REPELLED. The pantry’s aroma is now classified as a defensive liability. The audience is chanting the defenders’ names. Fan clubs are forming. This is how it starts.\"",
   "d13: ⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 66. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 5.\"",
   "d14: 📺 SYSTEM: \"AUDIENCE EXPANSION! Your party cap is now FOUR! The people demanded bigger ensembles! Don't let us down!\"",
   "d14: 📺 SYSTEM: \"A viewer sent this. A FAN. We checked. It is not dinner.\" A pause. \"We checked twice. The fans are very insistent that you open it ON CAMERA.\""
  ],
  "burialWindowSay": [
   "d13: That night, they bring Robin home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours.",
   "d13: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+6 integration)",
   "d15: You say a few words for Robin. Not a ceremony — just: you were here, and someone noticed you leaving. (-3 trauma)",
   "d15: Burying the bloating dead was honest work, and it cost you. Fever by nightfall. (-10 health)",
   "d15: You bury Robin. A marker, of sorts. The village will know where. (+4 trauma)"
  ],
